              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Using {{$context.$nodes.REFINE_PROGRAM_DATA.$output.result}}, output exactly one line in this format and nothing else:\n  Program Type: <type>\n\n  Rules:\n  1) Use ProgramType from REFINE_PROGRAM_DATA.\n  2) If ProgramType is missing/empty, keep <type> empty.\n  3) Capitalize the first letter of each word in <type>.\n  4) Do not output any extra text, labels, markdown, or punctuation beyond the exact format."
