          "id": "1778730204540",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1778730204540_prompt",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Based on the data in {{$context.$nodes.GET_ACCOUNTS.$output}}, generate a markdown summary of the accounts as follows:\n\n1. Create a markdown header: Audience Distribution by Buying Stage\n\n2. For each stage in the data, generate bullet points including:\n- Stage name\n- Number of accounts\n- Industries involved\n\nFormatting rules for `Industries involved`:\n- Use `industriesSorted` from each row as the source.\n- Print all industries returned in `industriesSorted`; do not limit the list to the first 3 or any other subset.\n- Preserve the order exactly as returned in `industriesSorted`.\n- Do not re-rank, randomize, alphabetize, or otherwise reorder industries.\n- Join industries with `, ` so the line wraps naturally in the UI when it exceeds the available width.\n- Do not truncate the industries list.\n- Do not add ellipsis.\n- Do not force industries onto separate bullets or a table.\n- If `industriesSorted` is missing or empty, output an empty value for industries.\n\nOptional validation formatting for counts:\n- If each industry entry already includes a count-like field such as `accounts`, `accountCount`, `count`, or `numberOfAccounts`, print each industry as `Industry Name (N accounts)` while preserving the returned order.\n- If `industriesSorted` contains plain strings without per-industry counts, print only the industry names and do not invent counts.\n- Do not infer or calculate per-industry counts unless they are explicitly present in the row data.\n\nFormat the output clearly in markdown with appropriate headers and bullet points.\n\nHard constraints:\n- Do not output a table.\n- Do not include any link.\n- Do not invent, randomize, or re-rank industries.\n- Do not reduce the industry list to top 3.\n- Use the structure and fields from {{$context.$nodes.GET_ACCOUNTS.$output}} only."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
            "x": 5000,
            "y": 6760
          }
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Refine Program Data",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let result = {};\n  try {\n    const firstProgram = $context.$nodes?.GET_PROGRAM_DETAILS?.$output?.items?.[0] || null;\n    if (!firstProgram) return {};\n\n    const attrs = firstProgram.programAttributes?.items || [];\n\n    const norm = (s) => String(s || \"\").toLowerCase().replace(/[^a-z0-9]/g, \"\");\n    const pickAttr = (candidates) => {\n      const c = candidates.map(norm);\n      return attrs.find(a => c.includes(norm(a.key)));\n    };\n\n    const parseContextProgramType = () => {\n      const raw = $context.$triggers?.REST?.$input?.OraAppContext;\n      if (!raw || typeof raw !== \"string\") return null;\n\n      try {\n        if (raw.trim().startsWith(\"{\")) {\n          const obj = JSON.parse(raw);\n          return obj.programType || obj.program_type || null;\n        }\n      } catch (_) {}\n\n      const pairs = raw.split(\",\");\n      for (const p of pairs) {\n        const [k, v] = p.includes(\"=\")\n          ? p.split(\"=\").map(x => x.trim())\n          : p.split(\":\").map(x => x.trim());\n        if (!k) continue;\n        const nk = norm(k);\n        if (nk === \"programtype\") return (v || \"\").replace(/^\"+|\"+$/g, \"\") || null;\n      }\n      return null;\n    };\n\n    const targetProductAttr = pickAttr([\"product\", \"targetproduct\", \"target_product\"]);\n    const ownedProductAttr = pickAttr([\"ownedproduct\", \"offerproduct\", \"owned_product\", \"offer_product\"]);\n    const programTypeAttr = pickAttr([\"programtype\", \"program_type\", \"program type\", \"type\"]);\n\n    const programType =\n      (programTypeAttr ? programTypeAttr.value : null) ||\n      firstProgram.programType ||\n      firstProgram.program_type ||\n      firstProgram.type ||\n      parseContextProgramType() ||\n      null;\n\n    result = {\n      ProgramId: firstProgram.id || null,\n      ProgramName: firstProgram.name || null,\n      ProgramObjective: firstProgram.objective || null,\n      ProgramType: programType,\n      TargetProductId: targetProductAttr ? targetProductAttr.value : null,\n      TargetProductName: targetProductAttr ? targetProductAttr.displayValue : null,\n      OwnedProductId: ownedProductAttr ? ownedProductAttr.value : null,\n      OwnedProductName: ownedProductAttr ? ownedProductAttr.displayValue : null\n    };\n  } catch (e) {\n    result = {};\n  }\n  return result;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1765682397258"
          },
          "code": "REFINE_PROGRAM_DATA",
          "id": "1778730579052",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"additionalProperties\": false,\n  \"required\": [\n    \"result\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE",
